  "f0_macros_sanitized": {
    "_comment": "M2: the six macros in the Global Ring (two on the Ring, four in the folder) all use only the built-in 'Generic' plugin: inline dynamic actions in the name ($@Generic___@ExecuteApplication___<arg>, $@Generic___@Sleep___<ms>) and editor commands defined in the macro itself (KeyboardKey, SendText). None references another action of the profile. Two kinds of keyboardKey occur: with a Windows platform part (fires) and the older form without one, which K2.1 found inert, and a Mac-only part (mac-<code>), which is inert on Windows. Arguments, names and text are replaced.",
