  "f1_folder_ui_written": {
    "_comment": "UI, Polish: a Folder added to slot 1 of an empty Notepad Ring, then Ctrl+Shift+Esc and Media Play/Pause added inside it. Saves in order: (1) profileActions += folderAction with folderName ''; (2) 0.4 s later folderPages += folderPage, folderName := its GUID, slot 1 := the folder; (3) profileActions += itemAction; (4) page.controls[0] := item (+ an .ict icon for the item only); (5) page.controls[1] := the system action. The page starts with NO controls and gains only the used ones: it is not padded to 8.",
